      "body": "There isn't currently a UI for this like the behavior you described on full story. The best way to accomplish it would be with a [before notify hook](https://docs.bugsnag.com/platforms/browsers/customizing-error-reports/) . This let's you modify the exception payload before it is sent to Bugsnag.\n\n``` js\nBugsnag.beforeNotify = function(payload, metaData) {\n  // Filter out sensitive information\n  payload.breadcrumbs = payload.breadcrumbs.map(function(crumb){\n    // Check \n    if(crumb.metaData.targetSelector.match(/SOMEREGEX/) {\n      crumb.metaData.targetText = 'HIDDEN';\n    }\n    return crumb;\n  });\n}\n```\n",
